    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly, the \"healing\" part sounds like a joke. how do you heal from being a pariah? you can't unring a bell. the truth is, the world has already moved on and decided i'm finished. i'm just stuck in this loop of existing in a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore. it feels like i'm just waiting for the rest of the world to catch up to the fact that i'm already gone.",
